# .terraform.lock.hcl
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is generated and maintained automatically by `terraform init`.
# It records the exact provider versions and checksums selected by the
# dependency solver so that every team member and CI run uses identical
# provider binaries regardless of which versions were published after init.
#
# COMMIT THIS FILE to version control — it is the IaC equivalent of a
# package-lock.json or Pipfile.lock and is essential for reproducible builds.
#
# To regenerate after changing required_providers in versions.tf, run:
#   terraform init -upgrade
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Run `terraform init` to populate this file with real provider hashes.
